    "body": "For folks watching this thread, @vmpstr has put together an initial pull request describing find-in-page in https://github.com/whatwg/html/pull/5770 ([direct preview link](https://whatpr.org/html/5770/interaction.html#find-in-page)). It's pretty basic and, I think, should be uncontroversial. But it might provide a good place to collect some of the notes or open issues here, e.g. we could expand it to link to https://w3c.github.io/string-search/#searching, and eventually try to define `window.find()` as triggering that feature.",
