    "created_at": "2024-02-27T10:40:14Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-27T10:40:14Z",
    "body": "Given that — along with the core _“highlight the active match and scroll into view”_ behavior — browser UIs also expose a count of the total matches for the current query, it’s imaginable that it might be useful to developers (and for testing scenarios too) to have an API which programmatically exposes that total match count to JavaScript code.",
